Captions for AIReceptionist_web.mp4 (34.1 seconds, 720x720, AAC audio).

This file is intentionally empty of cues. The video's spoken content has not been
transcribed, and inventing caption text for a demo of what the AI Receptionist says
to real customers would be worse than having no captions at all.

A file with zero cues is valid WebVTT: the browser loads it, finds nothing to show,
and displays nothing. No console error, no missing-file 404, no wrong words on
screen. Fill in the cues below from the actual audio and the track starts working
with no markup change.

Format, for whoever writes them:

  00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
  Line of speech, two lines maximum per cue.
